{"id":1060201,"name":"엔퍼·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"엔퍼·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1060201]}],"trial":{"trial_id":60201,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2023-01-17 14:00:00","diary1":"마녀의 밤이 끝나면서 엔퍼는 S급 수감자로 각성함과 동시에 깊은 잠에 빠졌다.\n　　일주일 후, 엔퍼는 깨어났고 당신은 의사에게서 엔퍼의 몸에 큰 문제가 없다는 걸 확인한 후, 그녀를 심문하기로 했다.","diary2":"엔퍼도 마녀의 밤의 힘에 대해서는 아는 게 별로 없었다. 하지만 당신들은 이 힘은 분명 수감자의 힘과 관련된 것이라 확신할 수 있었다.\n　　엔퍼는 당신과 같이 벨페고르 미술관으로 가서 조사하고 싶어 했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260305,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260306,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":1,"dialogue_id":160201003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":7,"dialogue_id":160201004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":3,"dialogue_id":160201008,"next":[9]},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":6,"dialogue_id":1,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160201023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":